Snowflake Data Marketplace — Complete Guide

Detailed Summary
What is the Data Marketplace?
The Data Marketplace is a public area within Snowsight (Snowflake's web UI) where users can browse, discover, and import third-party data shares directly into their Snowflake account — without any data movement, using the same technology as direct data sharing under the hood.

